    {
      "id": "footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1914,
      "width": 1240,
      "height": 132,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1401,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blocker codes (contract section 6 verification gates):\nB1 - published-datasource field-description write: released endpoint / operation and authoritative field-ID mapping unproven.\nB2 - composable datasource round-trip: deterministic .tds/.tdsx serialization and multi-parent publish->download->republish unverified.\nB3 - Pulse mutation semantics: create / update / delete (and follow / unfollow) request-response schemas, omitted-vs-null and idempotency / cascade behavior pending.\nB4 - shallow project pull / publish: exact direct-content enumeration and target-mapping contract (no child recursion) pending.  (B5 closed 2026-08-31; B6 closed 2026-09-02: live DELETE contract verified for workbook + datasource.)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Blocker codes (contract section 6 verification gates):\nB1 - published-datasource field-description write: released endpoint / operation and authoritative field-ID mapping unproven.\nB2 - composable datasource round-trip: deterministic .tds/.tdsx serialization and multi-parent publish->download->republish unverified.\nB3 - Pulse mutation semantics: create / update / delete (and follow / unfollow) request-response schemas, omitted-vs-null and idempotency / cascade behavior pending.\nB4 - shallow project pull / publish: exact direct-content enumeration and target-mapping contract (no child recursion) pending.  (B5 closed 2026-08-31; B6 closed 2026-09-02: live DELETE contract verified for workbook + datasource.)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
